WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.471
A product that comes in versions is one item with variants, and a

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:08.242
product can be sold at several prices.

00:00:08.242 --> 00:00:13.154
This video shows how to add options, create variants with their own SKU,

00:00:13.154 --> 00:00:17.940
price and picture, what shoppers see, and how to offer several prices.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:26.634
A shirt in three sizes and two colors is not six products.

00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:29.640
It is one product that comes in versions.

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:34.682
Making six items means six pages to keep in step, six prices to

00:00:34.682 --> 00:00:38.600
change, and shoppers who cannot see the choice they have.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:44.954
Variants keep one product, with a variant for each combination of its options,

00:00:44.954 --> 00:00:48.090
each with its own SKU, price and picture.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.199
Product prices go further:

00:00:51.199 --> 00:00:56.950
one item sold monthly, yearly, once, or for an amount the buyer chooses.

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:05.810
You give the content type its options, such as Size and Color, once.

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:10.315
On each product, you enter the values of each option.

00:01:10.315 --> 00:01:13.880
The product gets one variant for each combination.

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:19.003
Shoppers pick a variant before adding to the cart, and the cart and

00:01:19.003 --> 00:01:21.280
order record the one they chose.

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:24.276
The Product prices part is separate:

00:01:24.276 --> 00:01:27.860
it adds a Prices section with the ways an item can be bought.

00:01:32.062 --> 00:01:40.222
Open Content, Content Definition, Content Types, edit Product, click Add Parts, and add Product variants.

00:01:44.812 --> 00:01:48.163
Click Edit next to the Product variants part.

00:01:48.163 --> 00:01:53.026
Under Options, enter one option on each row, such as Size and Color.

00:01:53.026 --> 00:01:58.152
Tick Filterable for an option visitors can filter listings by, and save.

00:02:02.346 --> 00:02:08.377
On a product, under Variants, enter the values of each option, separated by

00:02:08.377 --> 00:02:11.355
commas, such as S, M, L, and save.

00:02:11.355 --> 00:02:16.866
The product gets one variant for each combination, such as S, Green.

00:02:17.317 --> 00:02:22.428
In the table that appears, Sold stops selling a variant without losing it.

00:02:22.428 --> 00:02:26.197
SKU is the variant's own, and each must be different.

00:02:26.197 --> 00:02:30.478
Price is the variant's own, and Compare-at price a was price.

00:02:30.478 --> 00:02:33.417
Image picks one of the product's photos.

00:02:33.867 --> 00:02:36.720
Leave a field empty to use the product's.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:41.213
When you change the values later, a variant keeps its SKU and prices

00:02:41.213 --> 00:02:43.277
while its combination stays.

00:02:47.477 --> 00:02:53.487
In listings, a product whose variants are priced differently shows From, with its lowest price.

00:02:53.487 --> 00:02:57.950
A filter on a filterable option finds the product when any variant on

00:02:57.950 --> 00:02:59.497
sale has that value.

00:02:59.948 --> 00:03:04.745
On the product's page, Add to cart offers one list for each option.

00:03:04.745 --> 00:03:09.344
The price, the SKU and the photo change to the chosen variant's.

00:03:09.344 --> 00:03:12.958
A value with no variant on sale cannot be chosen.

00:03:17.159 --> 00:03:19.740
Add the Product prices part to the type.

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:23.724
On a product, the Prices section lists the ways it can be bought.

00:03:23.724 --> 00:03:28.269
Fill in the first price, marked Default, and click Add a price for another.

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:32.758
Each price has a Name, an Amount and a currency.

00:03:32.758 --> 00:03:38.028
Charged is once or Recurring, and recurring shows how often to bill, the

00:03:38.028 --> 00:03:42.960
cycles, trial days, a delay before billing starts, and a setup fee.

00:03:43.848 --> 00:03:47.741
Offered from and Offered until limit when a price is offered.

00:03:47.741 --> 00:03:51.693
Buyer names the amount lets a buyer enter their own, such as a

00:03:51.693 --> 00:03:54.308
donation, within a minimum and maximum.

00:03:58.508 --> 00:03:59.544
Clothing:

00:03:59.544 --> 00:04:03.618
sizes and colors, with a stock keeping unit for each.

00:04:04.368 --> 00:04:05.960
A premium finish:

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:09.698
a variant with its own higher price and picture.

00:04:10.448 --> 00:04:11.388
A club:

00:04:11.388 --> 00:04:15.148
the same product sold once, monthly or yearly.

00:04:15.898 --> 00:04:17.006
A donation:

00:04:17.006 --> 00:04:19.158
the buyer names the amount.

00:04:21.158 --> 00:04:25.776
One product, a variant for each choice, and a price for each way to buy it.

00:04:25.776 --> 00:04:27.258
Thanks for watching.

